448 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Q\072  Is the NAINA corridor a good investment\077\nA\072 The infrastructure thesis is well documented\056 The outcome for any individual investor depends on developer selection\054 land title clarity\054 and holding period\056\n\nQ\072What is the Mumbai 3\0560 corridor\077 \nA\072 The Karnala\055Sai\055Chirner New Town \024 a 324 square kilometre planned urban expansion anchored by the Navi Mumbai International Airport\056\n\nQ\072  How do I verify the investment claims about NAINA\077\nA\072 Cross\055reference with the Colliers India report\054 the CIDCO NAINA planning documents\054 and press coverage of the infrastructure commitments\056 Oltraya\047s sources are linked at the bottom of this article\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
     /P 449 0 R
     /Pg 428 0 R
